# The images install their own dependencies (#1442); a checkout's node_modules, and what its runs
# leave behind, must never be copied over them.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
# No image copies the documents, and the audits' screenshots are 400 MB of context to send for nothing.
docs
# What a run leaves in a package (#1465): the E2E suite's stack and bucket, its traces and its load
# runs, every suite's report, and a browser test's build. deploy.test.ts holds this list to .gitignore.
**/.stack
**/.load
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.vitest-report.json
**/.playwright-report.json
packages/web/dist-*
# The tests' own Playwright browsers (#1508), hundreds of MB; the render image brings its own Chromium.
.playwright-browsers
